//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Tech: everything army-related off, then the pick's unit, morph chain and own upgrades back on.
// Ported from the old arcade map. Queens stay buildable by every Zerg with no cap; Ravens stay
// buildable by every Terran but can't use abilities unless picked; Medivacs can boost but
// never heal (Rapid Reignition stays off).
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
